Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:57.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Welcome to ProSeka AfterTalk: Colors of Pure Sense edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:01.96,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Good evening, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:05.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm Minori Suzuki, the voice of Ena Shinonome from Nightcord at 25:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:10.38,Ena,host,0,0,0,,This ProSeka AfterTalk is a program where we look back on the event,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:13.14,Ena,host,0,0,0,,while sharing messages we've received from all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:16.76,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Today, we're covering the Colors of Pure Sense event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:20.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Did everyone enjoy the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.12,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:25.84,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Between the Thanks Festival and the movie stage greetings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:30.54,Ena,host,0,0,0,,it's been pretty busy with all the real-life cast events lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:35.26,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And then right after that, we have this N25 event, an Ena focus event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:39.10,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's been a bit of a whirlwind for everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.50,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but I hope you've been enjoying it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:47.05,Ena,host,0,0,0,,We've gathered your comments for this AfterTalk sent through email,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:49.67,Ena,host,0,0,0,,as well as the submissions channel on the Discord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you all for your letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.80,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I was so curious about what everyone had to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:58.84,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask the staff to let me see all of them secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:04.94,Ena,host,0,0,0,,We'll go over some of your messages in our program today, so please look forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:09.10,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Also, please post your thoughts on the event or this broadcast
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:11.52,Ena,host,0,0,0,,using the hashtag #ProSekaAfterTalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:17.93,Ena,host,0,0,0,,We'll also be watching the YouTube chat, so please keep all the messages coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:18.61,Ena,host,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.56,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Some people saying, "I liked the story,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:24.52,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I see some "{\i1}kon-niigo{\i0}"s too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.64,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Yes, {\i1}kon-niigo{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:32.70,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Also, there'll be an AfterLive for this event at 10PM,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:37.00,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and the 3DMV for this event will be released at 10:05,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:40.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so I'd like to watch that with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:44.12,Ena,host,0,0,0,,We'll try to stick to the schedule,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:48.40,Ena,host,0,0,0,,{\i1}but{\i0} I did want to spend a bit longer watching the story this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:51.40,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I did ask staff if I could indulge myself on the story this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.86,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so we'll spend a bit more time watching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:56.68,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I hope you'll enjoy watching it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:12:05.76,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So with that, let's jump right into talking about the Colors of Pure Sense event story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:09.02,Ena,host,0,0,0,,How did you like the story, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:14.08,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Let's look back together while going over some of the messages you've sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:19.44,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So actually, this is the first time I've done an AfterTalk since they got renewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:22.98,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Last time I was here was a year ago, and that's around when the renewal happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:30.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so I haven't gotten a chance to bring your thoughts into the story talk yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.00,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:35.16,Ena,host_meta,0,0,0,,This letter is from Amelia Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:36.82,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This is the first time I'm writing in!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:37.76,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:43.98,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"My favorite scene was the one where Ena deletes her selfie account."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:48.07,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Seeing her decide to stop running away and finally confront her art
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:50.24,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,really showed how much she's grown."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:55.86,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Like Ena, I was also afraid of facing myself and kept running away,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:59.06,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"but seeing Ena's determination gave me the push I needed,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:00.96,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and made me want to do my best too."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:07.44,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Suzuki-san, what kind of feelings did you put into your performance of Ena this time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:10.32,Ena,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:15.32,Ena,host,0,0,0,,That was a wonderful message, Amelia Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:17.14,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:23.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk more about it while watching the story later,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:29.66,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but something I'm more conscious of when acting as Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:36.58,Ena,host,0,0,0,,both in this event and when singing recent N25 songs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:42.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,is her resolve to not go back to the old Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:46.48,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I personally kept that in mind because,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:57.15,Ena,host,0,0,0,,even if the pace is slow, Ena is moving forward bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:14:04.76,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So while N25's songs often have negative or pessimistic lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:08.80,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and the music usually has a darker mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.98,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I tried not to make that the main thing in this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:18.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Like, maybe if I were to add just a hint of tearing up or a regretful tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:24.48,Ena,host,0,0,0,,that might make a line, or the song as a whole, stand out more to the listeners' ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:28.48,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So people might say, "Oh, I like this part," or "that was nice, let me play that again."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:33.52,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Those kinds of lines would probably leave more of an impression on people's ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:41.08,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But that would just be my own desire for validation as Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:48.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I wanted to show Ena's gradual steps forward in both the songs and the story dialogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:58.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So even with the same words, I wanted to make sure you could feel that she's moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:06.40,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And so thinking of the story too, I sang more positively as the song went on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:11.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,That's what I kept in mind while performing this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:14.32,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And so... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:23.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,In this event and recent songs, she's realized that the world is warmer than she thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:28.68,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and she knows that the people around her will support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:31.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I made sure to reflect that in my performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:35.42,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Now, moving on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:39.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Let's read another message.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:42.98,Ena,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Sudachi Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.42,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello, Minori-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:45.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:48.98,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I read through Colors of Pure Sense."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.98,0:15:50.06,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:53.92,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"One scene that left an impression on me was in Episode 7,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:58.30,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"where Ena gets carried away with excitement after finding her own joy in painting."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:04.28,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Previously only feeling validation from others, like with her selfie account,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:06.45,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"she finally realized, 'I'm fine just as I am.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:11.02,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"'My world and the way I express myself can be as free as I want them to be.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:16.16,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Ena's world gradually becomes more colorful and her eyes start to sparkle,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.39,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"all as she finds her joy in painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:22.08,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I connected with that moment thanks to your voice, Minori-san,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.30,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It moved me to tears."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:27.42,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I want to continue watching over and supporting Ena,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:30.28,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"who has resolved not to give up on her art and her dreams."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:34.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,From Niyori-san... "Thank you so much for..." Oh, what a lovely message.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:38.78,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Thank you so much for bringing the colors of Ena's heart to life so vividly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.78,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,with your wonderful vocal performance."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:41.78,Ena,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:44.71,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm really the one who should be thanking you for appreciating it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:53.06,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I always hope that Ena's feelings will reach everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:58.74,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Of course, she's a character in a game, a 2D character,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:00.65,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but Ena is truly alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:06.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And no one knows what her future holds yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:09.50,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so I—how to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:15.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I really want to deliver something that feels real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:18.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So thank you for such a kind message.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:19.57,Ena,host,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:29.04,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, I still have so much to talk about. If I just keep chatting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:32.30,Ena,host,0,0,0,,it'll already be 10:05 and we'll have to skip watching the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.38,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So let's move right along.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.46,0:17:39.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I've picked out some scenes I personally want to talk about,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.44,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so let's watch them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:44.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I was a bit selfish today with the selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:48.12,Ena,host,0,0,0,,The staff are shaking their heads when I say "selfish,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:48.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But um,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:54.90,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I actually really wanted to watch from Episode 1 to 8 with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:18:00.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But let's just watch Episodes 7 and 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:05.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,This is an AfterTalk, so Minori will be talking quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.94,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Minori, uh, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:14.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So if you think I'm yapping too much, please go back and watch the story in the game later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.34,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.20,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Episodes 7 and 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.55,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.32,0:33:40.32,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I think she knew deep down all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.82,0:33:42.80,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Like, "I'm just avoiding it, aren't I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.80,0:33:47.12,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ena's already made so many promises to herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.95,0:33:57.96,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}so she knew she'd been using selfies as an escape or a crutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.72,0:34:00.00,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But she couldn't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.00,0:34:01.56,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She wants to go to Toubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.56,0:34:08.95,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But she wasn't ready to tell herself or those around her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.31,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But this time, she's telling herself "no, I {\i1}won't{\i0} run away,"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.31,0:34:18.30,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}and "I {\i1}will{\i0} decide."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.80,0:34:23.13,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She knows it's not a smooth road ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.13,0:34:26.18,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but it feels like the fog in her heart has cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.18,0:34:29.72,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She feels that relief, but also there's a lot ahead for her.
Comment: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:33.96,DefaultOnibe,host,0,0,0,,Below is an intentional duplication to make the transition from PiP to fullscreen smoother
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:33.96,Ena,host,0,0,0,,She feels that relief, but also there's a lot ahead for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.96,0:34:37.45,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I knew Ena had a lot on her mind about the road ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.84,0:34:43.00,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but I also knew that she felt a huge sense of relief
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.00,0:34:49.12,Ena,host,0,0,0,,after all this. So I acted with both of these feelings in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.12,0:34:56.75,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So actually, the reason I chose Episodes 7 and 8 is because of her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.75,0:34:58.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,They've been through a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.18,0:35:04.25,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and there were times she couldn't face him, but she really admires him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.25,0:35:07.35,Ena,host,0,0,0,,As she grew up a lot happened between them,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.35,0:35:11.45,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and he isn't the best with words, so she butted heads with him a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.45,0:35:14.55,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But as she grew as an artist,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.55,0:35:26.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,she started to remember those feelings of admiration for him she hid out of frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:31.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,That's why getting to voice young Ena was so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.62,0:35:39.15,Ena,host,0,0,0,,As a child, she was so pure. Everything was new and sparkling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.15,0:35:49.42,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And in that world was her father, and he was someone she looked up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.42,0:35:52.60,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Someone who creates amazing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.12,0:36:00.91,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I imagined Ena talking to him as just this mass of pure light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.91,0:36:07.26,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So I played that scene with Ena's feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.26,0:36:14.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,of wonder and delight she had for her father and his art.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.62,0:36:21.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And because of that, I could continue acting Ena's drawing scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.22,0:36:25.68,Ena,host,0,0,0,,while keeping that same wonderful and sparkling feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.68,0:36:30.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Playing that scene with Ena painting with so much joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.28,0:36:33.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,remembering those feelings she had watching her father,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.78,0:36:37.36,Ena,host,0,0,0,,that was really important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.12,0:36:41.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And for the first time, she could honestly say, "I'm having fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.22,0:36:47.54,Ena,host,0,0,0,,That was such an important point for Ena to reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.54,0:36:50.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,She's still on her journey, but she finally made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.32,0:36:53.52,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And so— Oh, I'm gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:59.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And so when— Ah, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.68,0:37:06.05,Ena,host,0,0,0,,When I first read the script at home, I cried so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.05,0:37:07.54,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I was just so happy for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.54,0:37:10.08,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Wah! This is a total broadcast accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.42,0:37:17.04,Ena,host,0,0,0,,It's been five years—well, not five years in Ena's timeline—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.04,0:37:19.12,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but there's been so much building up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.12,0:37:24.84,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I think many of you find Ena's story very relatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.84,0:37:33.15,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Since I'm also in a world of art where there are no "correct" answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.15,0:37:34.50,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I really understand her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.50,0:37:43.15,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But more than that, seeing Ena's hard work finally start to pay off...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.15,0:37:45.20,Ena,host,0,0,0,,well, "pay off" is oversimplifying a bit, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.20,0:37:46.20,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:59.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I was so happy that I cried for her as Minori Suzuki. I was like, "Good for you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:04.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And while reading, I felt Ena's relief that she finally made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.48,0:38:09.85,Ena,host,0,0,0,,She could finally feel this simple feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.85,0:38:14.64,Ena,host,0,0,0,,She's worked so hard to come to this point and finally let go of all that tension and angst.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.36,0:38:17.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry... I have plenty of tissues here.
Comment: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:23.64,DefaultOnibe,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:23.64,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I put all those feelings into the acting and the tears just started flowing naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.64,0:38:28.24,Ena,host,0,0,0,,There were parts where I got choked up and couldn't get the words out,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.24,0:38:29.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but that's what acting is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.28,0:38:34.45,Ena,host,0,0,0,,That actually helps get across Ena's feelings through acting all the more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.45,0:38:35.82,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Since I started crying—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.82,0:38:39.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Since I started crying as Ena, I knew she was crying with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.52,0:38:43.67,Ena,host_meta,0,0,0,,They actually adjusted to my timing—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.67,0:38:47.49,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So usually, you can click to advance the dialogue right as the line ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:51.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but they didn't cut any of the recording and let the pauses naturally hold
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.88,0:38:53.65,Ena,host,0,0,0,,before showing the next button.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.65,0:38:57.54,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:39:05.30,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I've received so many comments saying this was a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.30,0:39:12.42,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And it wasn't just about how my acting was, or how my voice sounded as Suzuki Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.42,0:39:21.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Instead of focusing on me, everyone really took {\i1}Ena's{\i0} attitude and determination to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.62,0:39:27.38,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So many people were glad for her, some felt encouraged to work hard too,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.38,0:39:33.12,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and long-time fans were just so glad to see her hard work pay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.12,0:39:42.81,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Even though her journey is just beginning, I'm so glad people care so much for Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.47,0:39:52.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I poured my absolute all into portraying Ena and how far she's come for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.28,0:39:54.58,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so I'm really happy with how it turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.58,0:39:55.43,Ena,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:56.07,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:58.56,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Now, let's take a look at the illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.56,0:40:01.21,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Also, I chose these episodes because they show when Ena,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.21,0:40:03.05,Ena,host,0,0,0,,after suffering so much while painting,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.05,0:40:07.05,Ena,host,0,0,0,,finally sees a glimmer of hope doing what she loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.05,0:40:07.75,Ena,host,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.34,0:40:15.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Let's spend about four minutes looking at the card illustrations together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.18,0:40:23.38,Ena,host_meta,0,0,0,,Before that, I have some comments about the costumes to share from the illustration team.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.38,0:40:31.32,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"The theme of this story is Ena's struggle to get into art school,"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.32,0:40:32.24,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"becoming discouraged
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.24,0:40:34.39,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}after not getting the grades she was hoping for,"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.39,0:40:37.52,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"but ultimately not giving up."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.52,0:40:41.52,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"Our motif this time was an art apron over a school uniform,"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.52,0:40:43.15,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"designed to capture Ena's look
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.15,0:40:45.42,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}as a student preparing for entrance exams."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.42,0:40:48.80,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"While she's had other apron outfits,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.80,0:40:52.64,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}this time we gave Ena a patched-up one."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.64,0:40:57.18,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"This represents her persistence through repeated setbacks,"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.18,0:41:00.14,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"fitting the themes from this specific story."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.14,0:41:03.80,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"We kept strong uniform elements
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:06.16,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}like the sailor collar and pleats,"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:08.82,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"but modified the overall form to give it more
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.82,0:41:09.92,Ena - PiP,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}of a costume feel."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.92,0:41:12.66,Ena - PiP,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And this is the illustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.02,0:41:17.06,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And then the untrained version...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.06,0:41:20.74,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}everyone seemed to really like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.74,0:41:22.50,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She looks like she's having fun painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.50,0:41:23.78,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Her hands are all messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.78,0:41:25.78,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.30,0:41:36.94,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(696,1608)}And here are the untrained and trained cards of everyone who supported Ena through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.78,0:41:43.22,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Kanade is a creator herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.22,0:41:45.29,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}so even though their genres are different,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.29,0:41:46.82,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}she understands Ena's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.82,0:41:47.80,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And KAITO...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.80,0:41:54.94,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Yeah, KAITO gave Ena so many important words of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.94,0:41:58.58,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}There's also that scene where they're eating ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.58,0:42:01.38,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So I named the team "Frozen Yogurt."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.38,0:42:04.72,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}That's just because I personally love frozen yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.72,0:42:06.14,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}My desires are leaking through.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.14,0:42:07.76,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And here's Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.76,0:42:08.61,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.62,0:42:11.10,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So many lovely paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.14,0:42:13.98,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Yeah, look, they're eating ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.01,0:42:15.82,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.54,0:42:19.58,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And finally, Mafuyu— wait, oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.38,0:42:22.49,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ah, I can't long-press.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.49,0:42:23.20,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:25.14,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She's holding her apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.14,0:42:26.50,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Yes, so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.18,0:42:29.68,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.68,0:42:34.94,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So, you've seen the untrained and trained illustrations...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.94,0:42:36.30,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Oh, come on—
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.30,0:42:38.34,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Anyway, those were the illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.58,0:42:41.66,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I have a few more minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.66,0:42:44.85,Ena - PiP,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}so I'll talk a bit more about the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.85,0:42:50.06,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So, in one of the previous stories—I'm trying to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.70,0:42:52.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Which was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.62,0:42:54.82,Ena,host,0,0,0,,The last one wasn't specifically about her art,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.82,0:43:01.98,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so I think it was the one before that, where we sang "I'm the Rain."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.98,0:43:05.60,Ena,host,0,0,0,,During that story about Ena's drawing—"drawing" sounds a bit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.60,0:43:12.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,About her {\i1}painting{\i0}, I happened to visit an art museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.62,0:43:17.82,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I got to feel what it's actually like to look at paintings, and through that,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.82,0:43:21.07,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I was able to understand and act as Ena better.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.07,0:43:24.72,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But before this event story, I was just walking down the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.72,0:43:29.33,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and I passed an actual art prep school, the kind Ena would attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.33,0:43:31.98,Ena,host,0,0,0,,It was just right there on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.98,0:43:38.56,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I felt this intense tension just looking from the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.56,0:43:43.82,Ena,host,0,0,0,,and it reminded me how tough her world is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.82,0:43:46.34,Ena,host,0,0,0,,And I put those thoughts into the recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.34,0:43:51.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Even if it's just small things like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.18,0:43:57.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,every time I perform, I do my best to share Ena's world with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.62,0:43:58.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.41,0:43:59.97,Ena,host,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.97,0:44:02.00,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.88,0:44:03.68,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.64,0:44:07.40,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I still have a few dozen seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.76,0:44:13.02,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Some of you might have already seen the AfterLive by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.02,0:44:16.48,Ena,host,0,0,0,,It follows the content of Episode 8,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.16,0:44:22.52,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so you can see Ena's refreshed expression. Things will still be hard for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.52,0:44:27.32,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but I hope her resolve comes through in her expression and her singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.32,0:44:34.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I hope it's reaching all of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.95,0:44:35.45,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:44:35.97,0:44:36.47,DefaultOnibe,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.97,0:44:36.47,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.24,0:44:39.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Man, it really is a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.18,0:44:41.58,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Ena is so loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.58,0:44:43.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful we got such a wonderful story.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.62,0:44:45.66,Ena,host,0,0,0,,With that said, I'd like to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.66,0:44:50.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,about the song commissioned for this event after we watch the 3DMV.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.18,0:44:51.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.57,0:47:03.92,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,And we're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:06.56,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,Sorry for suddenly popping back up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.56,0:47:10.75,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,That was the 3DMV for the song Chouchou-P wrote for this event,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.75,0:47:13.45,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,titled "The Name of Your Drawing."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.45,0:47:15.84,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I think this is the first time the title's been revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.24,0:47:21.33,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Sono {\u1}E{\u0} no {\u1}Na{\u0}mae wa{\i0}." That was the 3DMV.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.76,0:47:26.96,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,Should I do this first? Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.36,0:47:30.72,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,For a second, I mixed up my own notes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.72,0:47:32.44,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,with Chouchou-P's comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.44,0:47:33.72,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Wait, what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.72,0:47:40.04,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,OK so, let me read the notes I sent to the staff beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.56,0:47:44.84,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,"Just listening to it evokes memories of Ena's long journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.84,0:47:46.68,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,and it brings me to tears."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.68,0:47:51.26,Ena - Shifted,host_meta,0,0,0,,"The title has the 'E' and 'Na' from her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.26,0:47:54.12,Ena - Shifted,host_meta,0,0,0,,so I felt it was truly a song written for her."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.84,0:47:58.24,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,"Embracing the regret and pain that she's felt along her journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.24,0:48:00.57,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,instead of just lamenting it,"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.57,0:48:04.85,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,"I sang with her newfound optimism and determination,"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.85,0:48:08.18,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,"ready to turn those painful feelings into strength."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.18,0:48:11.04,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,That's what past-me sent in to the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.64,0:48:15.16,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,We already shared Chouchou-P's actual comments
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.16,0:48:16.70,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,on the ProSeka News Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.70,0:48:19.48,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,They should be on Twitter—I mean, X—as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.48,0:48:20.60,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,so please check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.16,0:48:24.56,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,But yeah, those were the feelings I put into the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.56,0:48:25.56,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.24,0:48:31.28,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,A lot of the lyrics talk about the pain she felt in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.28,0:48:33.97,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,but it's like she's looking back at those memories
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.97,0:48:35.76,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,as who she is {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.76,0:48:40.04,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure Ena has regrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.04,0:48:41.54,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,but I think she's someone who understands
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.54,0:48:44.66,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,that those regrets made her who she is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.66,0:48:47.45,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,So for the phrases about those regrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.45,0:48:50.53,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I didn't want to sing them
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.53,0:48:55.62,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,with the pure angst the old Ena might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.62,0:48:58.26,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,So while embracing those regrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.26,0:49:01.84,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I sang with her newer sense of resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.84,0:49:04.18,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,Like I said during the story part,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.18,0:49:06.15,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I tried to include that sense of relief,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.15,0:49:10.80,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,and the brightness she felt finding joy in painting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.80,0:49:15.81,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,But also that this isn't the goal; it's a new start.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.46,0:49:24.54,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I was very conscious of capturing that duality while singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.54,0:49:30.18,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,So rather than a huge outburst or breakthrough of emotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.18,0:49:36.70,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,it's more like her quietly reflecting to encourage herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.70,0:49:41.72,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,Like patting herself on the chest and saying, "Let's do this."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.72,0:49:46.32,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,That's the image I had in mind as I sang.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.32,0:49:48.70,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I just end up crying, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.58,0:49:52.14,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,I've already heard the full version, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.14,0:49:53.56,Ena - Shifted,host,0,0,0,,Since I'm the one who sang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.56,0:49:54.68,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Sorry~
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.68,0:49:57.04,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I just can't help but cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.04,0:49:58.82,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm just so hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.82,0:50:02.04,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Both this story and the song just make me tear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.04,0:50:03.72,Ena,host,0,0,0,,What am I going to do? What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.72,0:50:07.50,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I thought I wouldn't cry this time, but I did anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.06,0:50:08.92,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.92,0:50:15.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,To those of you who felt a bit jealous that I've heard the full version, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.70,0:50:22.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,The 2DMV for this new song, "The Name of Your Drawing,"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.22,0:50:27.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,will be uploaded to the official ProSeka YouTube channel at 10:15 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.62,0:50:31.72,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Please check that out along with the 3DMV.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.72,0:50:36.50,Ena,host,0,0,0,,If it's like the previous 2DMVs, that means you'll be able to hear the full version too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.18,0:50:40.60,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I haven't even seen the 2DMV myself yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.60,0:50:49.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Now, to give some belated thoughts on the 3DMV...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.18,0:50:52.44,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I sang the full song for the recording, but I knew how the lines were split,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.44,0:50:54.42,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so I knew which parts would be Ena's.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.42,0:50:59.60,Ena,host,0,0,0,,The song starts with the other three members of N25 singing one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.60,0:51:07.34,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So in the 3DMV inside my head—my imaginary 3DMV—it didn't start with Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.34,0:51:10.02,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I was wondering how it would actually begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.02,0:51:14.32,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Would all four, or rather five of them appear at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.32,0:51:18.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Or would it start with Mizuki, who has the first line?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.62,0:51:23.30,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But then I saw it was actually Ena in focus for the whole opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.30,0:51:26.44,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm always happy
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.44,0:51:32.58,Ena,host,0,0,0,,when other characters get a lot of screen time for their fans, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.58,0:51:41.08,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But this MV put such a huge spotlight on Ena, and it matched the story so perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.08,0:51:46.32,Ena,host,0,0,0,,It really felt like it was capturing Ena's journey and current attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.32,0:51:51.61,Ena,host,0,0,0,,As her voice actress, that made me so incredibly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.20,0:51:53.53,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Seeing her painting like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.53,0:51:55.62,Ena,host,0,0,0,,You know, I feel this every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.62,0:52:04.14,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but Ena's commissioned songs always feel like she's getting closer and closer to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.14,0:52:07.26,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Well, that's just my own otaku analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.26,0:52:08.86,Ena,host,0,0,0,,But things like that make me happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.86,0:52:15.22,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I've only seen it a few times myself, so I want to sit down and watch it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.22,0:52:17.71,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'm so excited for the 2DMV.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.71,0:52:18.35,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.50,0:52:24.46,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I think that's everything... I don't think I've left anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.46,0:52:29.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Well, I've truly entrusted everything to Ena's voice.
Comment: 0,0:52:29.78,0:52:37.78,DefaultOnibe,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.78,0:52:35.19,Ena,host,0,0,0,,More than anything, I hope you can feel Ena's thoughts and attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.19,0:52:37.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,through the music and the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.30,0:52:41.66,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Everyone, please continue to support Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.66,0:52:44.42,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.94,0:52:47.38,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Though I may not be Ena herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.38,0:52:55.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,as the person who voices her, I feel like I'm someone close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.18,0:53:07.28,Ena,host,0,0,0,,She's made a new resolution, and I'll work hard as an actress to express her growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.28,0:53:09.88,Ena,host,0,0,0,,so please keep watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.88,0:53:11.34,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.34,0:53:12.36,Ena,host,0,0,0,,It's been a short time,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.36,0:53:18.38,Ena,host,0,0,0,,but that's all for this ProSeka AfterTalk: Colors of Pure Sense edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.38,0:53:20.90,Ena,host,0,0,0,,To everyone watching the stream, how did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.46,0:53:28.00,Ena,host,0,0,0,,If you haven't finished the story for the Colors of Pure Sense event yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.00,0:53:31.14,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Did I look funny crying so much like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.42,0:53:38.02,Ena,host,0,0,0,,You can read the whole thing from the Event Story menu once the next event starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.02,0:53:39.60,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So please, give it a read.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.60,0:53:43.70,Ena,host,0,0,0,,We're always looking for messages for our AfterTalks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.70,0:53:51.86,Ena,host,0,0,0,,You can submit them through the official ProSeka Discord channel or via email.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.86,0:53:56.78,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Please send one in when the next AfterTalk event starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.78,0:54:00.60,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Just make sure your messages are related to the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.60,0:54:03.71,Ena,host,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste if I couldn't read it because it was about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.71,0:54:04.46,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.46,0:54:08.18,Ena,host,0,0,0,,In just about ten or twenty seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.18,0:54:12.94,Ena,host,0,0,0,,the 2DMV will be out, so let's watch it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.94,0:54:18.16,Ena,host,0,0,0,,I'll watch it as soon as we close out here, so you should all check it out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.16,0:54:21.56,Ena,host,0,0,0,,So with that, see you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.56,0:54:23.86,Ena,host,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
